# Report figures ARE part of the report. `*.png` above keeps generated samples and scratch images
# out, but it also silently dropped six plots from the 2026-08-11 profile commit -- `git add <dir>`
# reported success and the FINDINGS shipped with dangling image links. Every docs/*/plots/ figure is
# reproducible from its scripts/make_plots.py, but a report whose figures only exist on the machine
# that made them is not a report.
!docs/**/plots/*.png
